    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">TTM203 · Assessment 1/5</span>\n<h2>Case study analysis</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13234 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">TTM203 · Đầu điểm 1/5</span>\n<h2>Case study analysis</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13234 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">20.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">30'</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4, LO5, LO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Presentation</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Case study analysis and questions given with the case</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">All chapters</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Students will work in group of 4-5 students and will be scheduled to be in charge of one case study given in the coursebook (allocated by instructors) which is related to the topics learnt in the earlier weeks. They have to analyse the case study by answering the questions given with the case.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 9 — Student casestudy presentation and discussion 1: Part I</li><li>Session 10 — Student casestudy presentation and discussion 1: Part I (continue)</li><li>Session 21 — Student casestudy presentation and discussion 2: Part II</li><li>Session 22 — Student casestudy presentation and discussion 2: Part II (cont)</li><li>Session 39 — Student casestudy presentation and discussion 3: Part III and IV</li><li>Session 40 — Student casestudy presentation and discussion 3: Part III and IV (cont)</li><li>Session 53 — Student casestudy presentation and discussion 4: Part V</li><li>Session 54 — Student casestudy presentation and discussion 4: Part V (cont)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 9 — Student casestudy presentation and discussion 1: Part I</li><li>Buổi 10 — Student casestudy presentation and discussion 1: Part I (continue)</li><li>Buổi 21 — Student casestudy presentation and discussion 2: Part II</li><li>Buổi 22 — Student casestudy presentation and discussion 2: Part II (cont)</li><li>Buổi 39 — Student casestudy presentation and discussion 3: Part III and IV</li><li>Buổi 40 — Student casestudy presentation and discussion 3: Part III and IV (cont)</li><li>Buổi 53 — Student casestudy presentation and discussion 4: Part V</li><li>Buổi 54 — Student casestudy presentation and discussion 4: Part V (cont)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
