    "description": "Group assignment 20.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">TTM203 · Assessment 3/5</span>\n<h2>Group assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13234 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">TTM203 · Đầu điểm 3/5</span>\n<h2>Group assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13234 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">20.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">2000 words</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4, LO5, LO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Written report and presentation</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Tourism market to Vietnam: profile development and analysis</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">All chapters</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Students will work in group of 4-5 students and will be given a tourism market to be in charge of. They are required to develop a detailed profile of the market and to analyse the consumer behavior of the market. Basing on the profile and analysis, suggestions for product development, marketing activities and quality management should be made.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 24 — Group assignment guide 1</li><li>Session 48 — Group assignment guide 2</li><li>Session 55 — Group project presentation 1</li><li>Session 56 — Group project presentation 1 (cont)</li><li>Session 57 — Group project presentation 2</li><li>Session 58 — Group project presentation 2 (cont)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 24 — Group assignment guide 1</li><li>Buổi 48 — Group assignment guide 2</li><li>Buổi 55 — Group project presentation 1</li><li>Buổi 56 — Group project presentation 1 (cont)</li><li>Buổi 57 — Group project presentation 2</li><li>Buổi 58 — Group project presentation 2 (cont)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
